        "created_at": "2017-08-07T21:37:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Has anyone implemented a randomizer for this game, or come up with a good method for randomization? &nbsp;The main things that need randomization are Spirits, Island Boards, and Adversaries (and Scenarios), as everything else is easy to do by shuffling decks.</p><p>I'm fine writing my own, but I feel like something like this would be generally useful.</p>",
